Name Buak_Note_20

Interactability_Text_Line_0 1998-04-24
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 After yet another incident yesterday. People are right back to being miserable. Right after I gave them a raise, too! What a waste. And as if such a simple slip up couldn’t make things worse- I lost an entire floor of my facility. We have guns for a reason! The entire security arm needs to be fired for not firing off a single bullet when they had the chance.